  <article class="legal-page blog-post">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/blog/">Blog</a> &rsaquo; <span>Best AI Tools for Product Managers in 2026 (Tested by PMs)</span></nav>
